      "evidence": {
        "srt_stats": {
          "cue_count": 20,
          "max_chars": 138,
          "max_duration_s": 8.4,
          "max_chars_per_sec": 21.43,
          "cues": [
            {
              "index": 1,
              "start_s": 0.0,
              "end_s": 4.2,
              "duration_s": 4.2,
              "chars": 65,
              "chars_per_sec": 15.48,
              "text": "While I was dying in the delivery room, my husband was on a date."
            },
            {
              "index": 2,
              "start_s": 4.2,
              "end_s": 9.8,
              "duration_s": 5.6,
              "chars": 78,
              "chars_per_sec": 13.93,
              "text": "He told the nurse, \"I only want Irene to bear my children, not a dog like her."
            },
            {
              "index": 3,
              "start_s": 9.8,
              "end_s": 18.2,
              "duration_s": 8.4,
              "chars": 130,
              "chars_per_sec": 15.48,
              "text": "I died, but then I woke up. It was the day of our engagement. My ex sneered, \"Are you so desperate for me that you’re stalking us?"
            },
            {
              "index": 4,
              "start_s": 18.2,
              "end_s": 20.7,
              "duration_s": 2.5,
              "chars": 16,
              "chars_per_sec": 6.4,
              "text": "You’re pathetic."
            },
            {
              "index": 5,
              "start_s": 20.7,
              "end_s": 22.8,
              "duration_s": 2.1,
              "chars": 45,
              "chars_per_sec": 21.43,
              "text": "His mistress Irene giggled, \"Give up, Serena."
            },
            {
              "index": 6,
              "start_s": 22.8,
              "end_s": 24.3,
              "duration_s": 1.5,
              "chars": 26,
              "chars_per_sec": 17.33,
              "text": "Xavier will only marry me."
            },
            {
              "index": 7,
              "start_s": 24.3,
              "end_s": 27.8,
              "duration_s": 3.5,
              "chars": 53,
              "chars_per_sec": 15.14,
              "text": "You’re just a supporting character in our love story."
            },
            {
              "index": 8,
              "start_s": 27.8,
              "end_s": 29.9,
              "duration_s": 2.1,
              "chars": 41,
              "chars_per_sec": 19.52,
              "text": "They had no idea I remembered everything."
            },
            {
              "index": 9,
              "start_s": 29.9,
              "end_s": 33.5,
              "duration_s": 3.6,
              "chars": 65,
              "chars_per_sec": 18.06,
              "text": "The cold hospital, my dead baby, and my parents’ fatal car crash."
            },
            {
              "index": 10,
              "start_s": 33.5,
              "end_s": 38.8,
              "duration_s": 5.3,
              "chars": 53,
              "chars_per_sec": 10.0,
              "text": "I loved him with my whole heart, and he destroyed me."
            },
            {
              "index": 11,
              "start_s": 38.8,
              "end_s": 44.2,
              "duration_s": 5.4,
              "chars": 100,
              "chars_per_sec": 18.52,
              "text": "But I also remembered the secret: After I died, Xavier's terrifying uncle Timothy took his own life."
            },
            {
              "index": 12,
              "start_s": 44.2,
              "end_s": 46.3,
              "duration_s": 2.1,
              "chars": 33,
              "chars_per_sec": 15.71,
              "text": "He had thousands of photos of me."
            },
            {
              "index": 13,
              "start_s": 46.3,
              "end_s": 49.2,
              "duration_s": 2.9,
              "chars": 37,
              "chars_per_sec": 12.76,
              "text": "He had loved me in silence for years."
            },
            {
              "index": 14,
              "start_s": 49.2,
              "end_s": 53.7,
              "duration_s": 4.5,
              "chars": 72,
              "chars_per_sec": 16.0,
              "text": "When my parents asked who I wanted to marry, I didn't choose the nephew."
            },
            {
              "index": 15,
              "start_s": 53.7,
              "end_s": 58.4,
              "duration_s": 4.7,
              "chars": 69,
              "chars_per_sec": 14.68,
              "text": "I looked them in the eye and said: \"I want to marry Timothy Sherwood."
            },
            {
              "index": 16,
              "start_s": 58.4,
              "end_s": 65.9,
              "duration_s": 7.5,
              "chars": 138,
              "chars_per_sec": 18.4,
              "text": "Xavier used to scream at me for spending a penny. Now, Timothy sent me an unlimited black card. \"Spend it all, darling,\" his message read."
            },
            {
              "index": 17,
              "start_s": 65.9,
              "end_s": 68.2,
              "duration_s": 2.3,
              "chars": 23,
              "chars_per_sec": 10.0,
              "text": "I’m no longer a beggar."
            },
            {
              "index": 18,
              "start_s": 68.2,
              "end_s": 71.2,
              "duration_s": 3.0,
              "chars": 59,
              "chars_per_sec": 19.67,
              "text": "Irene cornered me, screaming that I was stalking \"her\" man."
            },
            {
              "index": 19,
              "start_s": 71.2,
              "end_s": 73.0,
              "duration_s": 1.8,
              "chars": 35,
              "chars_per_sec": 19.44,
              "text": "I laughed and whispered: \"Keep him."
            },
            {
              "index": 20,
              "start_s": 73.0,
              "end_s": 78.299,
              "duration_s": 5.299,
              "chars": 51,
              "chars_per_sec": 9.62,
              "text": "I’m busy buying a dress to become your future Aunt."
            }
          ]
        },
